exports[`injection and compaction match Chinese fixture goldens without a model call > knowledge injection 1`] = `
"Memory is read at trace:// addresses with read or grep, never a shell command. trace:// lists every address.
Address: trace://<layer>/S<n>/T<t>. Without /T<t>: the session's current head.
Layers: knowledge (what a fresh context there receives), compact (what compaction there injects), facts (the Turn's facts), raw (its Raw overview).
raw only: #E<k> gives one full entry and @role keeps one role, e.g. citation T12#E3@assistant of S7 is trace://raw/S7/T12#E3@assistant.
trace://K<id>, trace://F<id>: one knowledge item or fact.
Give a subagent trace://knowledge/S1 for background or trace://compact/S1 to continue, and tell it to use read.

<knowledge>
Items are grouped by category, then scope. Within a scope group, full items are ordered by last change, oldest to newest; for claims about the same object, the later full item takes precedence until maintenance merges them. Position does not compare items across categories or scopes. Title-only lines carry no claim. When a rendered set is split into 24 segments, read by the header's p[0] segment number, then position within that segment; a scope group may continue into the next segment. Arrival order is not recency.
Session S1.
